# 10. Versioned Research Record

AkbasCore has evolved through multiple experimental generations.

Historical releases and archival records should remain associated with the
architecture that existed at the time of publication.

Examples include:

| Research line | Archival DOI |
| --- | --- |
| AkbasCore 1.2 — Damped Resonance Alignment | `10.5281/zenodo.21356271` |
| AkbasCore 1.2 — Damped Resonance Alignment | `10.5281/zenodo.22396352` |
| AkbasCore 2.0 — DRA / MANIFOLD experimental branch | `10.5281/zenodo.22715555` |
| AkbasCore 2.1 — DRA / Synthetic Injection | `10.5281/zenodo.22735745` |
| AkbasCore 3.0 — SEASC | `10.5281/zenodo.22894413` |
| Runtime-to-Weight experimental record | `10.5281/zenodo.22907085` |

These records document different stages of the project.

They should not be interpreted as if every historical architecture were
identical to the current AkbasCore 3.2 motor.

